    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 80, fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
        ① 首页　·　课程入口与检索
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 106, width: 620, height: 386, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
