    </Text>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 720, top: 106, width: 500, height: 312, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Image src="assets/shot_course.png" style={{ width: 498, height: 310, objectFit: 'cover' }} />
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 720, top: 428, width: 500, fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
        学时可查、目录可跳，进度条与笔记就在学习区，不用跳到另一个页面。
    </Text>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 720, top: 486, width: 500, height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 720, top: 498, fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>
